WEBVTT

00:00:00.688 --> 00:00:01.856
AWARDS CEREMONY

00:00:02.064 --> 00:00:05.067
Congratulations on winning
the championship, Suiryu!

00:00:05.192 --> 00:00:07.194
There was a slight mishap
in the final,

00:00:07.361 --> 00:00:09.363
but in the end,
you won unscathed!

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:10.740
Unscathed?

00:00:11.907 --> 00:00:14.160
If he hadnt stopped just short,
ld have been...

00:00:15.244 --> 00:00:18.205
And now, an announcement
for stadium attendees.

00:00:18.497 --> 00:00:21.667
We have been informed that
monsters have appeared outside.

00:00:21.751 --> 00:00:22.418
Monsters?

00:00:22.543 --> 00:00:23.461
Again?

00:00:23.586 --> 00:00:26.255
— We'll be okay if we stay in here, right?
— Yeah, probably...

00:00:27.089 --> 00:00:28.924
No use dwelling on it.

00:00:29.592 --> 00:00:31.844
/just need to avoid him
from here on out.

00:00:34.263 --> 00:00:35.598
You're cute!

00:00:35.931 --> 00:00:36.891
Huh?

00:00:37.475 --> 00:00:38.809
Best to /et it go...

00:00:39.185 --> 00:00:40.144
What are those?!

00:00:40.436 --> 00:00:41.395
Look up there!

00:00:46.776 --> 00:00:48.194
Monsters!

00:00:48.277 --> 00:00:51.530
Look! They're carrying
Logy, Dave and Bazuzu!

00:00:51.947 --> 00:00:54.283
The competitors that were
taken to the hospital!

00:00:54.575 --> 00:00:55.576
I'm frickin' out of here!

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.620
You guys take care
of those things!

00:00:57.703 --> 00:00:58.663
Enjoy!

00:01:08.589 --> 00:01:11.467
Have we got
all the tournament fighters?

00:01:14.011 --> 00:01:18.182
Hmph. Nothing but scrubs here.
How the martial arts have fallen.

00:01:18.974 --> 00:01:19.975
Whatever.

00:01:20.685 --> 00:01:22.353
All of you...

00:01:22.478 --> 00:01:24.438
will become monsters!

00:01:38.911 --> 00:01:40.913
Through the once tranquil town

00:01:40.996 --> 00:01:43.290
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:01:43.374 --> 00:01:47.294
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.297
Who is going to take the lead

00:01:50.339 --> 00:01:52.800
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:01:52.925 --> 00:01:57.471
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:01:57.555 --> 00:01:59.640
We know, We are...

00:01:59.724 --> 00:02:02.184
HEROES!

00:02:02.309 --> 00:02:04.019
Why were you

00:02:04.145 --> 00:02:06.355
born of evil?

00:02:06.439 --> 00:02:08.399
If you wish to know

00:02:08.524 --> 00:02:10.818
I shall tell!

00:02:10.943 --> 00:02:16.824
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:02:16.991 --> 00:02:20.327
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:02:21.579 --> 00:02:26.167
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:02:26.292 --> 00:02:30.880
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:02:30.963 --> 00:02:35.509
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:02:35.634 --> 00:02:41.891
For a peace not filled
with hatred

00:02:42.057 --> 00:02:45.186
He must fight!

00:02:56.739 --> 00:03:03.662
THE RESISTANCE OF THE STRONG

00:03:04.246 --> 00:03:05.831
Become monsters, you say?

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.334
You'll have to go
through us heroes, first!

00:03:08.501 --> 00:03:11.295
— The heroes will stop you!
— Take him down!

00:03:13.422 --> 00:03:14.757
— Run for it!
— We're screwed!

00:03:14.882 --> 00:03:16.467
Did I kill them?

00:03:17.468 --> 00:03:18.427
A single kick...?

00:03:18.969 --> 00:03:21.931
I have not come here
to take your lives today!

00:03:22.765 --> 00:03:26.435
I am Goketsu,
from the Monster Association.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.062
Goketsu?!

00:03:28.145 --> 00:03:30.397
The champion of
the first Super Fight?!

00:03:31.357 --> 00:03:33.651
That you know who I am
simplifies things.

00:03:34.109 --> 00:03:36.153
You understand how futile
resistance would be.

00:03:36.278 --> 00:03:39.448
But Goketsu was killed years ago
by a monster!

00:03:39.615 --> 00:03:40.616
How could you be him?

00:03:41.408 --> 00:03:45.538
It's true that I was once
beaten by a monster

00:03:45.788 --> 00:03:47.873
and taken to the monsters' lair.

00:03:48.624 --> 00:03:51.460
But there, in exchange
for my cooperation,

00:03:52.127 --> 00:03:55.297
they offered everything
I could want

00:03:55.506 --> 00:03:57.466
in order to satisfy my ambitions!

00:03:57.967 --> 00:04:02.221
Becoming a monster allowed me
to break through those limits

00:04:02.304 --> 00:04:04.390
I could never overcome
as a human.

00:04:05.266 --> 00:04:09.311
You understand what that means?
The Goketsu I once was

00:04:09.395 --> 00:04:11.564
is beneath comparison
to the fighter I am!

00:04:11.814 --> 00:04:15.484
Now celebrate, for I have brought
the same gift for you.

00:04:16.151 --> 00:04:17.903
You will eat these monster cells.

00:04:19.655 --> 00:04:22.491
Do so, and you'll become
monsters yourselves.

00:04:23.158 --> 00:04:24.702
Refuse and you will be killed.

00:04:27.788 --> 00:04:29.331
Monster Association...

00:04:30.124 --> 00:04:31.750
What are your intentions?

00:04:32.209 --> 00:04:34.628
Are you simply bent on
destruction and slaughter?

00:04:35.087 --> 00:04:39.341
There can be no question that
monsters crave violence.

00:04:40.009 --> 00:04:43.053
But violence Is not
our sole objective.

00:04:43.304 --> 00:04:47.182
There is a new phase
we advance toward.

00:04:47.349 --> 00:04:49.810
Ah, but for now,
just watch.

00:04:50.019 --> 00:04:54.189
Observe the inherent frailty
of the human biology and spirit.

00:04:56.525 --> 00:04:57.526
Time to choose!

00:04:57.651 --> 00:04:59.361
Die, or become monsters.

00:05:00.362 --> 00:05:02.239
No! Don't do it!

00:05:12.541 --> 00:05:14.418
This is incredible!

00:05:14.543 --> 00:05:17.546
The power...
the violence flooding me!

00:05:17.922 --> 00:05:18.964
Hey, fat boy!

00:05:19.256 --> 00:05:21.634
I remember you mocking me
during our match!

00:05:26.263 --> 00:05:28.265
He wasn't near that strong before...

00:05:33.437 --> 00:05:35.397
If they have that much effect
on peasants,

00:05:35.481 --> 00:05:36.857
what will one do to me?

00:05:37.858 --> 00:05:41.070
My genetics reign supreme across
the entirety of human history.

00:05:41.737 --> 00:05:44.198
Ultimate strength awaits
within me to be woken.

00:05:44.782 --> 00:05:46.158
Choze, you're not...?!

00:05:51.622 --> 00:05:54.249
It has served not only to
improve physical function...

00:05:54.541 --> 00:05:57.461
but all my vast mental capacity
is at last unfettered as well.

00:05:57.753 --> 00:05:59.421
So "his is to be a monster...

00:05:59.588 --> 00:06:00.547
Let's see.

00:06:03.509 --> 00:06:04.468
Jakumen!

00:06:05.844 --> 00:06:09.306
I could kill that peon
with ease now.

00:06:09.598 --> 00:06:12.393
He humiliated me...

00:06:12.643 --> 00:06:14.853
And he shall rue that unto death!

00:06:15.813 --> 00:06:17.940
This one turned out fairly well.

00:06:18.315 --> 00:06:21.235
It's hit or miss,
depending on the raw material.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:24.822
Now then!
You insects eat up too!

00:06:25.906 --> 00:06:27.282
I don't want to die!

00:06:28.117 --> 00:06:29.118
Benpats!

00:06:29.243 --> 00:06:30.452
It's to survive.

00:06:31.161 --> 00:06:32.162
Hamukichi!

00:06:32.538 --> 00:06:33.789
I want to be strong.

00:06:34.623 --> 00:06:35.833
Not you, too, Boltane!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.424
It's like I could do anything!

00:06:45.843 --> 00:06:47.302
I feel so energized!

00:06:48.804 --> 00:06:50.639
They're all monsters!

00:06:50.973 --> 00:06:52.307
What do we do?!

00:06:52.933 --> 00:06:53.934
Hey there.

00:06:54.935 --> 00:06:57.813
If I chase them off, would you
go on a date with me?

00:06:59.314 --> 00:07:00.649
Okay, that's a deal!

00:07:00.983 --> 00:07:04.153
I'll work off the stress
from that final match!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.404
Oh ho?

00:07:05.487 --> 00:07:07.865
One of you still dares defiance?

00:07:08.157 --> 00:07:09.324
Enough talk, then.

00:07:09.825 --> 00:07:10.701
We make it a rule to eliminate

00:07:10.826 --> 00:07:12.828
any potential enemy
of the Monster Association.

00:07:14.079 --> 00:07:14.830
Destroy him!

00:07:14.997 --> 00:07:16.040
Dumbass playboy!

00:07:16.165 --> 00:07:19.334
Now you tind some silly
sense of justice?

00:07:21.211 --> 00:07:22.838
DEVOUR

00:07:24.089 --> 00:07:25.841
All I live for is enjoyment.

00:07:26.842 --> 00:07:27.843
And guys like you...

00:07:29.928 --> 00:07:31.305
... Just get in my way.

00:08:00.709 --> 00:08:02.961
Heh. You're not bad.

00:08:03.587 --> 00:08:04.546
Not bad?

00:08:05.005 --> 00:08:07.216
Your vacuous mentality
is an affront.

00:08:09.218 --> 00:08:10.511
W-What's that?

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:12.262
I have decided.

00:08:12.888 --> 00:08:14.598
I shall repopulate this world

00:08:14.723 --> 00:08:17.226
only with those who meet
my exacting standards.

00:08:17.601 --> 00:08:19.228
You worms do not.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:20.938
You shall be eliminated.

00:08:27.903 --> 00:08:29.363
Is this all?!

00:08:36.537 --> 00:08:37.538
Impossible!

00:08:42.668 --> 00:08:45.921
That didn't meet
my exacting standards.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.840
Try making it a little more fun.

00:08:48.215 --> 00:08:49.424
Insufferable fool...

00:08:52.928 --> 00:08:54.596
They're moving too fast to see!

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:58.183
Dark Body Quake Tiger Fist!

00:09:04.106 --> 00:09:06.275
Dark Body Phoenix Rising Fist!

00:09:12.447 --> 00:09:14.032
Nice work!

00:09:14.324 --> 00:09:15.534
Ouch...

00:09:15.826 --> 00:09:17.619
Can't remember the last time
I got cut...

00:09:18.412 --> 00:09:19.538
That was amazing, though...

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:23.125
That monsterfication thing
made them really tough.

00:09:23.667 --> 00:09:26.837
Killing you will be
a bit of a waste.

00:09:27.546 --> 00:09:29.464
There's still time to change sides.

00:09:30.465 --> 00:09:32.926
From here on, the world will
belong to monsters.

00:09:33.802 --> 00:09:36.722
In it, the strong will be able to
go wild, killing as they please,

00:09:37.014 --> 00:09:38.599
enjoying true freedom.

00:09:39.141 --> 00:09:41.143
A world of bloodlust and violence.

00:09:41.727 --> 00:09:44.688
As a monster,
you'd find your "life of fun."

00:09:45.314 --> 00:09:47.232
Not a bad deal, eh?

00:09:49.234 --> 00:09:49.943
He wouldn't...!

00:09:50.652 --> 00:09:52.154
You make a point.

00:09:52.863 --> 00:09:55.866
You're saying regardless of
what world I live in,

00:09:55.991 --> 00:09:58.327
if life is fun, it's all good.
That it?

00:10:00.996 --> 00:10:02.247
Nah, I refuse.

00:10:02.664 --> 00:10:06.126
I'd rather die than look
as fugly as you!

00:10:06.668 --> 00:10:09.129
Dark Body Flying Dragon Fist!

00:10:09.671 --> 00:10:10.172
Yes!

00:10:16.803 --> 00:10:18.805
Then die.

00:10:20.349 --> 00:10:21.975
Watchdog Man!

00:10:22.142 --> 00:10:23.518
Way to go!

00:10:23.602 --> 00:10:24.519
Thank you!

00:10:24.645 --> 00:10:27.189
You're City Q's guardian angel!

00:10:27.689 --> 00:10:30.192
I see why they consider him
a Class S.

00:10:31.526 --> 00:10:34.488
Monsters attacked just as I was
about to pick a fight.

00:10:35.364 --> 00:10:38.867
His speed and powerful
fighting ability were surprising,

00:10:38.992 --> 00:10:40.035
but that's all.

00:10:41.286 --> 00:10:43.789
I can handle that
in any number of ways.

00:10:44.289 --> 00:10:48.377
Watchdog Man,
It's your turn to be hunted!

00:10:51.713 --> 00:10:54.383
Are you human?
Or monster?

00:10:56.301 --> 00:10:58.262
Fist of Flowing Water
Crushing Rock!

00:11:00.305 --> 00:11:01.265
I didn't say "shake"!

00:11:03.558 --> 00:11:07.562
This guy Is definitely
nothing but speed and power.

00:11:08.522 --> 00:11:11.942
But the freak's got way more
of both than I thought.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:15.529
What's the matter?
Done already?

00:11:16.071 --> 00:11:18.240
Get up.
I'll give you three seconds.

00:11:18.699 --> 00:11:19.658
Three...

00:11:19.741 --> 00:11:20.742
Two...

00:11:20.993 --> 00:11:21.868
One.

00:11:30.711 --> 00:11:32.254
That's it! Good!

00:11:32.421 --> 00:11:34.256
Fight as if your life
depended on it!

00:11:38.927 --> 00:11:40.762
Damn! He's not even flinching.

00:11:40.929 --> 00:11:42.055
What can I do?

00:11:42.264 --> 00:11:44.099
You all can have your fun, too.

00:11:50.314 --> 00:11:51.315
Nooo!

00:11:51.732 --> 00:11:53.108
This Is bad...

00:11:53.191 --> 00:11:55.402
Now, now.
Don't get distracted!

00:12:00.073 --> 00:12:01.116
/s it broken?

00:12:01.825 --> 00:12:03.452
Come. What's the matter?

00:12:06.705 --> 00:12:08.957
Get up.
I'll give you three seconds.

00:12:09.541 --> 00:12:10.584
Three...

00:12:10.751 --> 00:12:11.710
Two...

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:12.961
One.

00:12:17.632 --> 00:12:19.843
Dark Body Quake Tiger Fist!

00:12:22.637 --> 00:12:24.806
I put everything into that strike...!

00:12:31.855 --> 00:12:32.522
He's strong...

00:12:32.981 --> 00:12:35.692
Stronger than me...in all respects.

00:12:37.819 --> 00:12:38.779
So this...

00:12:40.155 --> 00:12:41.281
.../s a monster?!

00:12:47.996 --> 00:12:49.331
Eat up, boys!

00:12:49.539 --> 00:12:51.500
That meat is a real delicacy.

00:12:51.583 --> 00:12:52.626
Pick him clean!

00:12:56.046 --> 00:12:58.340
Once, they were my disciples.

00:12:58.757 --> 00:12:59.883
But they were weak-willed

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:02.803
and lost their sense of self
after becoming monsters!

00:13:06.139 --> 00:13:06.932
Crap!

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.353
/f I don't do something,
I'm bird food!

00:13:14.856 --> 00:13:15.816
Hey, you!

00:13:15.941 --> 00:13:18.026
We're in trouble here!
Help me out!

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.196
Suiryu...

00:13:21.696 --> 00:13:23.532
Watching the finals,
it was clear.

00:13:23.573 --> 00:13:25.367
You're stronger than me.

00:13:25.867 --> 00:13:28.286
There's no way that I can beat you.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:29.871
I accept that.

00:13:29.996 --> 00:13:33.375
But right now,
you're about to be killed.

00:13:33.667 --> 00:13:34.668
lronic, isn't it?

00:13:35.252 --> 00:13:38.130
You made it to the top
of the human world,

00:13:38.255 --> 00:13:40.549
yet against these monsters,
you're no match.

00:13:40.882 --> 00:13:42.968
Then let's team up!

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.386
My mind's made up.

00:13:46.888 --> 00:13:48.723
I'm going to become a monster.

00:13:49.391 --> 00:13:51.518
Resign yourself to dying here!

00:13:53.728 --> 00:13:55.981
I don't need to be
the strongest human anymore!

00:13:56.064 --> 00:14:00.235
My goal now is simply to become
the strongest creature alive!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.863
Aw! He ate them all!

00:14:03.155 --> 00:14:04.406
Greedy bastard.

00:14:04.656 --> 00:14:05.615
Keep barking!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.118
In a second, I'm gonna shut
that big mouth you got!

00:14:11.621 --> 00:14:13.665
Looks like your body
can't keep up.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.210
The monsterfication failed.

00:14:18.378 --> 00:14:21.465
That just leaves you.

00:14:21.923 --> 00:14:23.925
HERO ASSOCIATION HOSPITAL

00:14:26.553 --> 00:14:30.265
There are patients back there
in the ICU that can't be moved.

00:14:30.474 --> 00:14:32.809
At a time like this,
a hero doesnt back down!

00:14:32.934 --> 00:14:35.270
In the end, heroes are only human.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:39.399
Your kind exist only to be
dominated by monsters.

00:14:43.612 --> 00:14:45.113
All the others either ran

00:14:45.614 --> 00:14:47.282
or have been defeated.

00:14:47.991 --> 00:14:49.284
Aren't you lucky?

00:14:49.367 --> 00:14:52.204
Your cries of pain
won't embarrass you now.

00:14:52.412 --> 00:14:54.831
Now, let's hear him scream.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:56.917
Coiling Defense!

00:14:59.794 --> 00:15:01.630
Lightning Kick!

00:15:03.798 --> 00:15:05.634
Snek, Max...

00:15:06.134 --> 00:15:07.177
You're both okay?

00:15:08.428 --> 00:15:11.348
Why? Why'd you come back?

00:15:12.474 --> 00:15:13.475
To save you.

00:15:15.018 --> 00:15:17.604
In our hero outfits,
we're different fighters.

00:15:18.146 --> 00:15:20.232
These jacket and slacks
protect me against

00:15:20.315 --> 00:15:22.275
monster claws, fangs, even beaks.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.402
This is my Battle Suit!

00:15:24.778 --> 00:15:27.030
And I put on my Lightning Shoes.

00:15:27.572 --> 00:15:30.200
Now's when we show
what we can really do!

00:15:30.408 --> 00:15:32.244
We're up against three of them.

00:15:32.827 --> 00:15:34.412
Can we leave one to you?

00:15:34.829 --> 00:15:35.372
Yeah!

00:15:43.838 --> 00:15:46.341
You did save me. Thanks.

00:15:46.841 --> 00:15:49.344
Tank-top Tackle!

00:15:54.182 --> 00:15:56.351
That was...a great tackle.

00:15:56.977 --> 00:15:59.062
You risk too much
for a guy without a tank top.

00:15:59.688 --> 00:16:01.523
Can you stand, Mumen Rider?

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:02.732
Yeah.

00:16:03.233 --> 00:16:04.359
You bet I can.

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:08.530
Okay, my legs can still move.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.365
Time to go!

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.411
Why are you two
getting ready to fight?!

00:16:15.203 --> 00:16:16.788
We'll hold him off.

00:16:17.038 --> 00:16:18.290
It'll give you time to escape.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:19.416
That's stupid!

00:16:19.541 --> 00:16:21.084
You don't stand a chance!

00:16:21.543 --> 00:16:23.378
Neither of you could
even outfight me!

00:16:26.047 --> 00:16:27.048
They can't be Serious...

00:16:27.465 --> 00:16:28.675
Don't they feel fear?

00:16:36.766 --> 00:16:38.268
I won't get another chance.

00:16:38.476 --> 00:16:40.729
Run, go, escape!

00:16:41.187 --> 00:16:42.147
I have to get—!

00:16:43.648 --> 00:16:48.236
Where you going?
The fun's all right here!

00:16:54.117 --> 00:16:56.745
I hit the jackpot with this one.

00:16:57.579 --> 00:17:01.416
You look the same as me:
a threat level Dragon!

00:17:03.043 --> 00:17:04.419
Damn right!

00:17:04.836 --> 00:17:07.547
Oh? He's getting up again?

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.267
First, objective number one.

00:17:20.101 --> 00:17:25.231
Create terror amongst the humans
via rampage and chaos.

00:17:25.523 --> 00:17:27.734
At this, we have been
extremely successful.

00:17:27.817 --> 00:17:29.611
No refuge nor safe harbor remains.

00:17:30.654 --> 00:17:33.406
All has been enveloped in a cloak
of uncertainty and fear.

00:17:33.907 --> 00:17:35.450
Objective number two.

00:17:35.867 --> 00:17:40.121
Secure a hostage
from the Hero Association.

00:17:40.455 --> 00:17:41.873
This also was successful.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.709
The son of an important executive
is in our hands.

00:17:45.293 --> 00:17:47.462
And objective number three.

00:17:47.587 --> 00:17:49.798
Turn significant humans
into monsters.

00:17:50.006 --> 00:17:51.466
This, too, is proceeding well.

00:17:51.883 --> 00:17:54.386
Nyaan infiltrated a prison,

00:17:54.469 --> 00:17:57.722
monsterfied those inmates
who were inherently evil,

00:17:57.806 --> 00:17:59.349
and now leads them here.

00:17:59.683 --> 00:18:03.144
Goketsu has also turned several
martial artists into monsters.

00:18:03.395 --> 00:18:06.481
I anticipate they will make
valuable additions to our ranks.

00:18:07.607 --> 00:18:09.818
Goketsu's still at work?

00:18:10.527 --> 00:18:11.820
Attention, Goketsu!

00:18:11.986 --> 00:18:13.321
Come back immediately.

00:18:13.863 --> 00:18:15.198
If some Class S heroes arrive,

00:18:15.323 --> 00:18:17.450
even you may not be able
to handle them.

00:18:17.742 --> 00:18:19.452
Bah! You underestimate me.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:21.830
But I'm done here.

00:18:22.664 --> 00:18:23.998
Hey, new guy.

00:18:24.124 --> 00:18:25.125
Huh?

00:18:25.333 --> 00:18:27.419
I'm taking you to our lair.
Follow me!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:32.507
You don't give Bakuzan orders!

00:18:42.183 --> 00:18:43.435
Hear me out.

00:18:43.852 --> 00:18:45.228
In the Monster Association,

00:18:45.353 --> 00:18:47.731
many are stronger than you,
including me.

00:18:48.022 --> 00:18:49.691
Don't get carried away.

00:18:50.775 --> 00:18:53.570
The monsters will be returning
to the lair now.

00:18:54.112 --> 00:18:56.865
That means that the heroes,
including Class S,

00:18:56.948 --> 00:18:59.075
will be coming for
any remaining monsters.

00:18:59.576 --> 00:19:01.745
They'll be too much for you
to handle alone.

00:19:02.454 --> 00:19:04.205
You've been warned.

00:19:04.539 --> 00:19:05.707
I'm going.

00:19:07.208 --> 00:19:09.669
The lair's in the wasteland
outside City Z.

00:19:09.878 --> 00:19:11.379
Find us there.

00:19:13.089 --> 00:19:14.591
Hear that, Suiryu?

00:19:14.883 --> 00:19:17.051
Monsters everywhere.

00:19:17.302 --> 00:19:18.970
Unbelievable, eh?

00:19:19.429 --> 00:19:21.723
I felt his power and now,
I'm scared.

00:19:23.475 --> 00:19:26.060
Yeah, I'm done. No more trying
to be the strongest.

00:19:26.728 --> 00:19:28.480
You know what, Bakuzan?

00:19:29.606 --> 00:19:32.233
I have no will to fight anymore.

00:19:32.567 --> 00:19:33.443
C'mon...

00:19:34.068 --> 00:19:36.196
Just let me live.

00:19:36.696 --> 00:19:38.031
Look, Suiryu.

00:19:38.406 --> 00:19:39.783
You should know I'm the type...

00:19:42.619 --> 00:19:44.454
Stop!

00:19:44.579 --> 00:19:48.583
...who loves beating on anyone
weaker than me!

00:19:48.708 --> 00:19:51.753
That's the only reason I ever
wanted to become strong!

00:19:53.755 --> 00:19:57.342
Now that I've thrown off my limits,
I've never felt better!

00:19:58.593 --> 00:20:00.261
How about the other one?!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.724
Suiryu, screaming in pain.

00:20:05.058 --> 00:20:08.144
Too bad there's no audience
to hear it!

00:20:09.687 --> 00:20:15.985
You had youth, ability, popularity,
money, women and freedom...

00:20:16.444 --> 00:20:19.864
Think you took
too much for granted?

00:20:22.158 --> 00:20:26.371
Now you'll experience a hell
that wipes all that away, then die.

00:20:29.415 --> 00:20:31.709
You look absolutely pathetic,
"champ."

00:20:34.212 --> 00:20:38.174
Somebody! Help me!

00:20:38.716 --> 00:20:39.968
A monster!

00:20:40.051 --> 00:20:42.846
There's a monster here!

00:20:43.137 --> 00:20:45.056
Is anyone out there?

00:20:45.306 --> 00:20:47.141
A monster's attacking me!

00:20:48.142 --> 00:20:49.477
Please!

00:20:49.602 --> 00:20:53.898
I need...a hero!
Can any heroes hear me?!

00:20:54.148 --> 00:20:56.025
I'm over here!

00:20:56.234 --> 00:20:57.318
Heroes!

00:20:57.485 --> 00:20:59.320
Please! Help me!

00:21:00.238 --> 00:21:02.365
There's a monster here...

00:21:02.824 --> 00:21:03.992
Heroes...

00:21:04.284 --> 00:21:07.120
No one can hear you.

00:21:07.537 --> 00:21:08.872
No hero's coming.

00:21:09.831 --> 00:21:11.332
You're going to die.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.586
There's no one who can match him...

00:21:15.169 --> 00:21:17.505
Even the strongest hero
couldn't save me.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:19.924
But I'm begging you...

00:21:20.633 --> 00:21:22.468
Get up...please!

00:21:24.262 --> 00:21:26.431
When a person fs thrust
into the deepest darkness,

00:21:27.473 --> 00:21:29.434
they seek a ray of light...

00:21:30.351 --> 00:21:34.981
lt doesnt matter how small
or faint it may be...

00:21:36.524 --> 00:21:38.359
Just the fact that it's there...

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:39.861
...glves hope.

00:21:41.404 --> 00:21:44.240
This is what it is
to be without hope!

00:21:48.786 --> 00:21:49.704
What?

00:21:54.208 --> 00:21:55.919
Who are you?

00:21:57.337 --> 00:21:59.881
Just a...hero.

00:22:01.716 --> 00:22:04.719
I heard you calling for help,
Suiryu.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.597
You fought hard on your own.

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.391
Let me take care of the rest.

00:22:26.366 --> 00:22:31.371
We painted different dreams
into our hearts

00:22:31.412 --> 00:22:36.167
With the struggles that we faced
In the past

00:22:36.709 --> 00:22:42.173
Will the future call
or Will it slio away?

00:22:42.256 --> 00:22:47.178
There's just so much
that we don't know

00:22:47.428 --> 00:22:52.684
But one day, weil make peace
within ourselves

00:22:52.934 --> 00:22:58.356
Weil be able to forgive
everything in our past

00:22:58.439 --> 00:23:03.528
We tell ourselves to forget,
but nothing seems to fade

00:23:03.611 --> 00:23:07.615
That's what we are to each other

00:23:07.699 --> 00:23:14.038
If you hold out your hand
Youll see the bonds that show us

00:23:14.163 --> 00:23:18.543
That kindness Is the true strength

00:23:18.626 --> 00:23:24.966
Theyre something that I need
To keep on moving on

00:23:25.091 --> 00:23:30.346
So I promise that I'll come back

00:23:30.471 --> 00:23:36.310
I promise that lil come back to you

00:23:45.653 --> 00:23:50.283
THE TROUBLES OF THE STRONGEST
